{
  "abstract": "A combinatorial arrangement of pseudolines in the real projective plane, given as a generalised map with flags labelled by lines, in which no line carries fewer than three vertices, is four lines in general position or contains five lines in general position, a pencil of three and a pencil of two in which none of these five lines joins the two centres, or the complete quadrangle.",
